  "content": "[Intro]\n[D]\nAnd\n\n[Verse 1]\n[D]now, the end is\n[Dmaj7]near And so I\n[D/C]face the final\n[B7]curtain My\n[Em]friend, I'll say it\n[Em/D]clear I'll state my\n[Em/C#]case, of which I'm\n[D]certain I've\n[D7]lived a life that's\nfull I traveled\n[G]each and every\n[Gm]highway And\n[D]more, much more than\n[A7]this, I did it\n[Asus4]my\n[D]way Re-\n\n[Verse 2]\n[D]grets, I've had a few\n[Dmaj7]But then again,\n[D/C]too few to\n[B7]mention I\n[Em]did what I had to\n[Em/D]do and saw it\n[Em/C#]through without ex-\n[D]emption I\n[D7]planned each charted\ncourse, each careful\n[G]step along the\n[Gm]byway And\n[D]more, much more than\n[A7]this, I did it\n[Asus4]my\n[D]way Yes, there were\n\n[Chorus]\n[D]times, I'm sure you\n[D7]knew When I bit\n[G]off more than I could\nchew But through it all,\n[Em]when there was\n[A7]doubt I ate it\n[F#m]up and spit it out\n[Bm]I faced it\n[Em]all and I stood\n[A7]tall and did it\n[G]my\n[D]way I've\n\n[Verse 3]\n[D]loved, I've laughed and\n[Dmaj7]cried I've had my\n[D/C]fill, my share of\n[B7]losing And\n[Em]now, as tears sub-\n[Em/D]side, I find it\n[Em/C#]all so a-\n[D]musing To\n[D7]think I did all\nthat And may I\n[G]say, not in a\n[Gm]shy way Oh,\n[D]no, oh, no, not\n[A7]me, I did it\n[Asus4]my\n[D]way For what is a\n\n[Chorus]\n[D]man, what has he\n[D7]got? If not him-\n[G]self, then he has\nnaught To say the\n[Em]things he truly\n[A7]feels and not the\n[F#m]words of one who\n[Bm]kneels The record\n[Em]shows I took the\n[A7]blows and did it\n[G]my\n[D]way\n[D]\n[D7]\n[G]\n\n[Outro]\n[Bm]\n[Em]Yes,\n[A7]it was\n[G]my\n[D]way",
